    "statClassification": "None",
    "description": "Born from the grief of a god who descended to earth after the tragic loss of his beloved wife, the Eyes of the Heavenly Founder bloodline carries a legacy of divine sorrow and unparalleled power. This deity, in his mourning, bestowed upon his descendants the ability to see and manipulate chakra in ways no mortal could ever comprehend. It is said that this god's tears, infused with celestial energy, crystallized into eyes that could pierce the veil of reality itself.<br><br>\n\nThese divine eyes became the cornerstone for the creation of the four S-rank bloodlines in Seichi, each inheriting a fragment of their progenitor's immense power. The bearers of the Eyes of the Heavenly Founder are marked by their luminous, celestial eyes that glow with an otherworldly light, reflecting their godly heritage.\n<br><br><p style=\"color: #FF0000;\">This is an S-rank bloodline and CANNOT be purchased directly </p>",
